@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html

### List seeded plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/plans

### Re-index plans (config-first, explicit trigger)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/indexing/reindex/plans

### AI plan recommendation (returns scores + hydrated plans)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/plans/ai/search?q=team%20collaboration%20api%20access%20analytics&limit=3

### App-level plan search endpoint (returns only plans)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/plans/search?query=priority%20support%20large%20organization&limit=3

### Debug: show which AI/indexing beans are active
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/debug/indexing/components

### Debug: mutate + index + search end-to-end
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/debug/indexing/demo?mode=sync

### Guest login (returns numeric userId + UUID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/guest/login

### Natural language orchestration (position-aware: support)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "1",
  "sessionId": "subhub-session-1",
  "conversationId": "chat-subhub-1",
  "position": "support",
  "query": "Which subscription plan is best for a small team that needs API access and analytics?"
}
